  "question": {
    "text": "If <math><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>m</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>5</mn></math> is a tangent to <math><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup><msup><mrow><mi>y</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mi>a</mi><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>b</mi><msup><mrow><mi>y</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup></math> at point <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1,2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>,</mo></math> then the value of&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>a</mi></math>&nbsp;is equal to"
