  "solution": {
    "text": "<math><mi>P</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1,2</mn></mrow></mfenced></math> lies on the curve and line, hence<br /><math><mi>L</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>=</mo><mi>m</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>m</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></math><br /><math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">u</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">v</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo><mn>8</mn><mo>=</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>8</mn><mi>b</mi></math><br />Also, <math><mfrac><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfrac></math> at <math><mi>P</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1,2</mn></mrow></mfenced></math> for the curve should be <math><mi>m</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>,</mo></math><br />i.e. <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>3</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>.</mo><mn>3</mn><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><msup><mi>y</mi><mo>'</mo></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>a</mi><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>b</mi><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><msup><mi>y</mi><mo>'</mo></msup></math><br /><math><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>24</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>12</mn><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>12</mn><mi>b</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfenced></math><br /><math><mo>&#8658;</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>12</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>a</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>36</mn><mi>b</mi></math><br /><math><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>12</mn><mi>b</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn></math> &amp; <math><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>8</mn><mi>b</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>8</mn></math><br /><math><mo>-</mo><mn>20</mn><mi>b</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></math><br /><math><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>5</mn></mrow></mfrac></math> and <math><mi>a</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>16</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>5</mn></mrow></mfrac></math>"
